-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261031.1 (2026-10-31)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * The desktop recommends the programs everyone uses from first boot, whatever their roles say (lists/image.list, Daniel's picks): our browser, PlasmaTube, Marble, the KDAB stereo demonstrator, Haruna, Blender, Kdenlive, Krita, Showfoto, KolourPaint, digiKam, Universal Media Server and its settings page, OpenRGB, Kubrick, the Graphics page and the locale tool
  * The developer, gamer, simmer, creator and student tasks place our remaining builds (FLTK tools, the benchmark suite, opentrack, protontricks, QEMU's data, Vibe, Marble's Behaim globe); lists/check-programs-placed.py fails for any program left in no list
  * The system meta requires the repository's current KWin (+stereo3d39), KScreen (+stereo3d10) and Mesa (+stereo3d17)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261025 (2026-10-25)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Kernel pair now depends on kernel build 13 (7.3.0-13+lc1), Linux 7.3 with the edition's series
  * The v3 and rt kernel meta packages follow (7.3.0+stereo3d13+lc1)
  * Hardware support recommends sparky-stereo-vram-boost, which turns on the VRAM helpers where an AMD GPU has its own VRAM

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261024.1 (2026-10-24)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Kernel pair now depends on kernel build 12 (7.3.0~rc6-12+lc1), which stays below 4 GiB on 32-bit UEFI
  * The v3 and rt kernel meta packages follow (7.3.0~rc6+stereo3d12+lc1)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261023 (2026-10-23)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Kernel pair now depends on kernel build 10 (7.3.0~rc6-10+lc1)
  * The v3 and rt kernel meta packages follow (7.3.0~rc6+stereo3d10+lc1)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261016 (2026-10-16)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * New task-sparky-stereo-developer: KDE's development tools first, toolchains, version control, containers and virtual machines, GPU debugging, game engines and libraries
  * New task-sparky-stereo-os-developer: the development files of the stereo stack at the edition's versions, packaging, the proof rig and benches; it brings the developer task
  * Both developer tasks depend on sparky-stereo-skills, are listed in tasksel and are installed on request (sparky-stereo does not pull them in)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261010 (2026-10-10)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Dolphin and Konsole in the desktop's recommended applications
  * FAT32, exFAT and NTFS tools in the system's required packages
  * Allow a disposable build directory for isolated package builds

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261004 (2026-10-04)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Our Mesa (GLX, EGL and Vulkan stereo) and the Vulkan stereo layer in the Depends of sparky-stereo-system; the layer is on by default

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261002.2 (2026-10-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Added firmware-nvidia-graphics to sparky-stereo-hardware-support (nouveau firmware, GSP included)
  * Kernel pair now depends on kernel package build 5 (7.3.0~rc1+stereo3d5)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261002.1 (2026-10-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Runtimes moved to Recommends, no versioned library in Depends
  * Added linux-image-sparky-stereo and linux-headers-sparky-stereo
  * Stereo stack (kernel, KWin, KScreen) in the Depends of sparky-stereo-system

